OL,4,CArchers fans urged to back fight to    
OL,5,Ckeep show in city                      
OL,6,GAudiences attending the final          
OL,7,Gperformances of The Archers' 75th      
OL,8,Ganniversary roadshows are being urged  
OL,9,Gto back a campaign to keep the long-   
OL,10,Grunning soap in Birmingham.            
OL,12,FThe BBC has shelved plans to build a   
OL,13,Fdrama studio at its new base in the    
OL,14,Fcity - which entertainment union       
OL,15,FEquity said threatened to "undermine   
OL,16,Feverything that makes The Archers so   
OL,17,Fspecial to millions of people."        
